    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PowerDirector 2025 Ultra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate your vision with high quality video editing software featuring an intuitive interface and advanced AI-powered tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Background Remover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flawlessly remove backgrounds from your footage or automatically cut out subjects from videos or images to add to other creations \u2014 no green screen needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/96ebbb375fe78bf3f5fac37fb912b6b8.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Auto Face Blur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto detect, selectively apply, and modify Mosaic and Gaussian blur effects to multiple faces in your video frames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/004f3ef285f77b7aac470d8a48cfa262.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Motion Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add text, graphics, and effects that follow objects with near perfect accuracy in your clips with frame-by-frame motion tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/94885261df4a438f9186d42a23a9fe7a.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Body Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly apply striking visual effects to moving people or objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/5c468f5e9711f592ea9060042e37a38e.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Title Masks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom masks with an intuitive designer to composite and design unique titles, images, graphics, or videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/7cb26634f4f043dfc03af850f923aa09.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyframe Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take total control of your projects and fine-tune effects, animations, and masks with enhanced keyframing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/38f0d0bd9b7886c150277ca55451c70b.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 modes to layer and blend videos and images to create surreal and impactful imagery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/d758636754191489202a8120c2e09c8f.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of Intro Templates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save time with thousands of customizable video intros and an intuitive template designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/b8d2c2c2231455a5826d66a0e84b95a2.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Animated Titles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add titles with unique animated templates that include motion graphics and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/d2bed2dbf99ddd420a375eb26ad330f6.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Stabilizer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix unwanted camera shake with a state-of-the-art video stabilizer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/94b7805cf499307d805808e7df08662c.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PowerDirector 2025 Ultra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate your vision with high quality video editing software featuring an intuitive interface and advanced AI-powered tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Background Remover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flawlessly remove backgrounds from your footage or automatically cut out subjects from videos or images to add to other creations \u2014 no green screen needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/96ebbb375fe78bf3f5fac37fb912b6b8.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Auto Face Blur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto detect, selectively apply, and modify Mosaic and Gaussian blur effects to multiple faces in your video frames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/004f3ef285f77b7aac470d8a48cfa262.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Motion Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add text, graphics, and effects that follow objects with near perfect accuracy in your clips with frame-by-frame motion tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/94885261df4a438f9186d42a23a9fe7a.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Body Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly apply striking visual effects to moving people or objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/5c468f5e9711f592ea9060042e37a38e.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Title Masks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom masks with an intuitive designer to composite and design unique titles, images, graphics, or videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/7cb26634f4f043dfc03af850f923aa09.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyframe Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take total control of your projects and fine-tune effects, animations, and masks with enhanced keyframing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/38f0d0bd9b7886c150277ca55451c70b.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 modes to layer and blend videos and images to create surreal and impactful imagery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/d758636754191489202a8120c2e09c8f.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of Intro Templates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save time with thousands of customizable video intros and an intuitive template designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/b8d2c2c2231455a5826d66a0e84b95a2.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Animated Titles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add titles with unique animated templates that include motion graphics and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/d2bed2dbf99ddd420a375eb26ad330f6.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Stabilizer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix unwanted camera shake with a state-of-the-art video stabilizer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345460/extras/94b7805cf499307d805808e7df08662c.avif?t=1754574190\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
